{"text":"Nevertheless, the challenges of sustained Liberian growth and development remain both awesome and performable. Our stability is eroded by thousands of returnees from U.S. presence in regional refugee camps, the bulk of whom are lacking in technical skills. Our peace is threatened by furious neighborhood tensions where we live. Two out of our three neighbors have either experienced or narrowly avoided civil war in the past year, and we patiently host refugees since not even a decade ago, it was they who hosted so many of us. Implementation of our economic development agenda is constrained, not by funding alone, but also by slow project execution and low absorptive capacity.","words":[{"text":"Nevertheless","start":0.0,"end":1.14,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":2.48,"end":2.64},{"text":"challenges","start":2.64,"end":3.22},{"text":"of","start":3.22,"end":3.62},{"text":"sustained","start":3.62,"end":4.24},{"text":"Liberian","start":4.24,"end":4.94},{"text":"growth","start":4.94,"end":5.18},{"text":"and","start":5.18,"end":5.38},{"text":"development","start":5.38,"end":5.86},{"text":"remain","start":5.86,"end":6.36},{"text":"both","start":6.36,"end":6.76},{"text":"awesome","start":6.76,"end":7.36},{"text":"and","start":7.36,"end":8.7},{"text":"performable","start":8.7,"end":9.36,"punct":"."},{"text":"Our","start":10.6,"end":10.8},{"text":"stability","start":10.8,"end":11.3},{"text":"is","start":11.3,"end":11.82},{"text":"eroded","start":11.82,"end":12.3},{"text":"by","start":12.3,"end":12.62},{"text":"thousands","start":12.62,"end":13.04},{"text":"of","start":13.04,"end":13.38},{"text":"returnees","start":13.38,"end":14.02},{"text":"from","start":14.02,"end":14.22},{"text":"U.S","start":14.22,"end":14.56,"punct":"."},{"text":"presence","start":14.56,"end":14.86},{"text":"in","start":14.86,"end":15.12},{"text":"regional","start":15.12,"end":15.56},{"text":"refugee","start":15.56,"end":15.96},{"text":"camps","start":15.96,"end":16.76,"punct":","},{"text":"the"